    "body": "So, I think the outermost contenteditable **editable** attribute value win **in** innermost contenteditable=false element if there is. It may be reasonable that the algorithm refers active element as the origin to consider innermost/outermost.  If so, HTML spec may need to define that outermost edting host in innermost contenteditable=false should have focus whrn Selection range(s) is in it.",
